{"step_index":935,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:19:28Z","thinking":"While the background task completes, other work can be addressed.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Investigate public revenue datasets and APIs","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"// Researching public revenue datasets in Korea\n// 1. DART (Open DART API): Requires API key, covers only external audit corporations (외감법인)\n// 2. G2B (조달청 나라장터): http://data.go.kr - 조달청 계약/입찰 기업 실적 및 재무정보\n// 3. National Pension Service (국민연금공단 국민연금 가입 사업장 내역): 공개데이터에 사업장명, 사업자등록번호 앞6자리, 업종, 주소, 당월고지보험료(원), 가입자수(명) 제공\n//    - Note: 국민연금 고지보험료를 통해 월 소득총액(소득구간) 추정은 가능하나 '매출액' 자체는 아님\n// 4. K-Report / CRETOP / NICE Bizinfo: Corporate credit bureau DBs (commercial/paid for financial statements)\nconsole.log('Public revenue research module initialized.');\n","Description":"Note on public revenue data sources","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\scratch\\revenue_sources_memo.js","toolAction":"Writing revenue research memo","toolSummary":"Write revenue sources memo"}}]}
